    "ix.23": "Physical regions & settlement patterns — Surface map work",
    "ix.24": "How & why Texans adapted to and modified the environment, and the consequences — Deep concept map, Transfer",
    "ix.25": "How the free enterprise system works, including supply & demand — Surface, Deep",
    "ix.26": "Earning a living by region; physical-geographic factors; limited resources; transportation & communication — Surface, Transfer",
