    "ix.34": "📝 <b>A note on fairness:</b> the fence fights were real and sometimes turned violent. Keep the family and community decision centered on <b>land, water, fairness, and how a shared resource should be used</b>, and handle the conflict briefly and age-appropriately. Guidance is in the facilitator guide.",
    "ix.35": "▶ Start Phase 1 — Surface",
